==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Ultimately from the name of the Celtic tribe of [[w:Boii|Boii]] inhabiting the area.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# a [[region]] in the west of the former [[Czechoslovakia]] and present-day [[Czech Republic]].

